Starting in one of the V5.* versions the Security Configuration
GUI allows you to choose "SHADOW", which turns off most
of the additional features of Enhanced Security (C2).

The various features are described in the prpasswd man page
and the default man page.  You can change them using the
dxaccounts GUI, usermod (for some features), and/or the
edauth tool.  There is information on the use of these tools in
the Security manual as well as the associated man pages.




