Dr. David Kirkby wrote:
> I have a Dec Alpha 600a which has a floppy drive. How can I get
> 'mount' a floppy disk that has been formatted on a PC under Windoze?
> What is the device file for the floppy ?
> 
> 

Depend from your OS-Version
----------------------------
TRU64 Version 5.n:
- use the "mtools" to copy files from/to the floppy drive,
   mount is not possible.
   i.a.: mcopy unix.fil a:\   #copy the unix file file.fil to
         the floppy drive

         mcopy a:\windo.fil . # copy the Windows file windo.fil
         to the Unix filesystem .

Hope this helps.

	Joerg-Uwe

