Hi,

You can do the following:
1)   "vdump" all the fsets (#1 and #2) on a tape (device ntape)
2) boot from the Install CD and exit to get the prompt
3) disklabel -z the disks and create new label
4) create domains then fsets on disk #2
5) "vrestore" the fsets from the tape on disk #2
6) shutdown and reboot on disk #2

You can contact me by mail if you want

Bye




